[](images/39/39e03f3df5d6dd4a54b575a823498cda07cbe15e21e05a9cde5e0ad900def247.svg)\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n![](images/96/966a241524851dd38dc511f730fa023c3b2755f67a7fb1f6476ef4caf083ba94.svg)\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ![](images/de/def1e6afa80a61af78e69da17bdf65200185f760454a98ffa8b56142cd99b08f.svg) as ![](images/3a/3a4f4cfc9409e86d8918647d161f6cccccd1ba270e603575b8fc9f5167e58a48.svg) these solutions approach the origin as ![](images/e5/e54727d514ed264e6dd30c7f4044746e6d2b4b462dc3776daecf7eb68634c358.svg)\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/ff/ff535f17581c5a93045c3c23b8b33ca2996be6dfca63ed7808bc5fec809d2377.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ![](images/d5/d57858ae72e3b836de8c930917b65bcfef13cd3b85518933523024f84905a05b.svg) has the equation \n![](images/8f/8f96aa73ce843c7815a1fed6bf3f3774a173cfa4d56f13e1f3a8c48d53cd7097.svg)\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n![](images/b2/b2a991e2b459a17fc02d58d3eb267f04c03d03f8224561bc234513aa5dfc8a7a.svg)\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ![](images/b2/b2e3de236be1367c614d785fd065d91340a14b9197fb77734c537161645f69ba.svg) as ![](images/3a/3a4f4cfc9409e86d8918647d161f6cccccd1ba270e603575b8fc9f5167e58a48.svg) these solutions approach the origin as ![](images/e5/e54727d514ed264e6dd30c7f4044746e6d2b4b462dc3776daecf7eb68634c358.svg)\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/31/317fe507f591931ea371db43b78a83b1741c427ef89dd90571f0a0030ed70c20.png)\n\nFor this particular system, we have\n![](images/87/878b11e2e3f3f3aaa6133482d483f1aa22ff420ade2a3d9533692f04c47348d1.svg)\nthus, ![](images/e2/e2c67900a3ba263aad1f200c892be4d755ab441e6b96ad6317e9364121f597b4.svg) is the eigenvalue that determines the long-term behavior (dominant eigenvalue).\n\nSince the dominant eigenvalue is ![](images/41/413cdb74711dd235ff727690ee5fb8713e6f50cbb49d131121a40b18b0943f53.svg) solutions become parallel to the straight-line solution containing the vector !