ath} :answer/value "\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303290} :answer-field/id #uuid "e0b7cb9e-f7bc-573b-9182-364bef9139c2" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304688}] :question/id #uuid "d494c60c-f7b6-57dd-bc5e-36909dfce486" :question/math-academy-id "q-332833" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=2x(t)+y(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are ${\\lambda }_{1}=-1$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=2,$ for which the corresponding eigenvectors are ${v}_{1}=[1,\\text{ }-1]^{T}$ and ${v}_{2}=[1,\\text{ }2]^{T},$ respectively. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}={c}_{1}\\cdot {{field-1}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\cdot {{field-2}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny={{field-3}}\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{-t}\\to $ \n{{field-4}}\nas $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach \n{{field-5}} \nas $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/f1/f1335e5420fe6e475cded1092e9b1ba621e0d88f46110b69ffef5e35ed080d6e.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny={{field-6}}\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{2t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nlie on that line.\n\nSince ${e}^{2t}\\to $ \n{{field-7}}\nas $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach \n{{field-8}} \nas $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space. \n\n![](images/a5/a53bb4e6cd7552b92424b168d0cda90fa1085b5e72fbf8a3c37a3a948bdcf9ad.png)\n\nThe {{field-9}}  of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/ec/ecccffb89d43b8de4ce0952d9b8d9686e74670b4d86b29687c76355b70a6ac7d.png)" :question/worked-solution "The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}={c}_{1}{e}^{-t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}{e}^{2t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=-x\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{-t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{the origin}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/f1/f1335e5420fe6e475cded1092e9b1ba621e0d88f46110b69ffef5e35ed080d6e.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=2x\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{2t}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{2t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{infinity}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/a5/a53bb4e6cd7552b92424b168d0cda90fa1085b5e72fbf8a3c37a3a948bdcf9ad.png)\n\nThe $\\text{phase portrait}$ of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/92/923e79b665f4529e579776188731896e6ce301743394e2102132f2cee7f6eaa9.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308394 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "707684fd-d61c-5ad5-987f-4be798154167" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306223} {:answer/id #uuid "c158e131-b3d3-5c44-8b42-3e8ab79bb634" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306958} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a5e7803-ba23-5644-b9a3-535e1c533454" :answer-field/key "field-10" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307559} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3567efc6-2526-50d6-8643-d4db89345a55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305660} {:answer/id #uuid "96ae813b-fe73-5e83-8552-0e711f877084" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306569} {:answer/id #uuid "a0a31034-dda6-508c-bb40-67f85a6deb95" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306656} {:answer/id #uuid "f5a9acf5-e8ee-549f-a7ed-29481531540d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307427}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306656} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b9570d6-9f71-5f61-acb5-1b3f33fd85e4" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307614} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2aad34bf-30dd-5293-adfd-a47392f06e06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{4t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305558} {:answer/id #uuid "3c9fa833-941c-59b2-b0d3-e1a749ce19e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{3t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305732} {:answer/id #uuid "c6699406-5fc1-5e59-b2d1-06e8d21cdb02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{-4t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306998} {:answer/id #uuid "f9752bc5-c8ce-510f-a3aa-fa32cfdfd491" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{-3t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307463}] :answer