ield-8}}." :question/worked-solution "The straight-line solutions of the system have the form\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\,\\text{and}\\,{c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}x,\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/1f/1f166fad96cd30dbc0b9cf05fdabcccd26cd68e25fc26b91ae357d4015813614.png)\n\nThe tangents along this line are pointing $\\text{away from the origin},$ meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nmust approach $\\text{infinity}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{1}>0.$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=-x,\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/cb/cbb8268b959a09af3d0b57573ff08f45a2fb87f376d87f284df49cd5094412d9.png)\n\nThe tangents along this line are pointing $\\text{toward the origin},$ meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nmust approach $\\text{the origin}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{2}<0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308440 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ebb7247-d920-5f19-a054-f3be245ae329" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the origin" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305758} {:answer/id #uuid "aa2587d1-2c35-5630-8a3f-2a3d766f0b82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "infinity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the origin" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305758} :answer-field/id #uuid "048f75b0-3308-58d6-8fd0-7540aece1c8d" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type