herefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 0+(\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 0+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ 0\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292862 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ba8f9b9-ebe4-5a92-ad85-2a5904c716b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291226}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291226} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c71c1d5-29c4-5775-add9-5e009062a4d6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292231} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e10b6b5-317f-5bfd-9061-ca77b2bc0961" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290889}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290889} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc3870f6-6b6d-59e8-8173-92df64daaeb3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292314} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4898d33f-f280-50da-be31-36b295222808" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290931}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290931} :answer-field/id #uuid "d71ef47c-19b6-5afb-8eb0-dcde40324c55" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292389}] :question/id #uuid "18c8e800-9586-55d4-91d2-1e71b341e0e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-275527" :question/problem "Find the product $AB,$ if\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & -5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{5} & -6 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$\nand \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $AB=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & -5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{5} & -6 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 0+(-5)\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 0 \\\\ 3\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 1+(-6)\\cdot 0 \\\\ 7\\cdot 0+(-8)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311868 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56ac8b17-7e11-562c-a2ac-7541b297f973" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309401}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309401} :answer-field/id #uuid "4597226b-1e40-5a57-9b8c-bc1cc3c255a1" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310980} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77e81909-6879-5cff-9653-ee1f5d1086cf" :answer/type {:db/ident