 =\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ \\sqrt{6} \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311869 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11b3f0dd-74d0-583b-bb4a-bb0d59b17444" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308876}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308876} :answer-field/id #uuid "67c68364-75fc-5500-bef6-cf4b7471352e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186311066} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7e220bc-4934-5cee-81e8-1138696c2368" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310101}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310101} :answer-field/id #uuid "e3ed6ee1-1baa-5e48-ba92-de3d6a8f3ade" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186311454} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ff976a50-acde-5602-99fd-b519fc0b7549" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310789}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310789} :answer-field/id #uuid "e62526c6-58be-5fda-ae6b-8c758a9606b3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186311462}] :question/id #uuid "e9963060-de5c-5656-9e7e-cf990bd21bb4" :question/math-academy-id "q-337668" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$\nand \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & \\sqrt{3} & 5 \\\\ 4\\sqrt{2} & -1 & 0 \\\\ 7 & -3\\sqrt{5} & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $AB=$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $B$ by the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $2$nd *row* of $B.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & \\sqrt{3} & 5 \\\\ 4\\sqrt{2} & -1 & 0 \\\\ 7 & -3\\sqrt{5} & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311870 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6541b6d3-e8ce-576d-b74b-a9972271e9ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309529}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309529} :answer-field/id #uuid "29e23049-fb20-55b2-85d3-1a5ea98a7667" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310903} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "997b5a05-1cb5-50b9-8355-27cc4f1db1d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}(3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309984}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}(3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309984} :answer-field/id #uuid "2dc591e2-5d5b-5c67-9799-1b09ea4ba1c1" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310912} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "588ed6f0-00a9-5f5b-94d9-e883724465cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{19}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309418}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{19}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309418} :answer-field/id #uuid "80b09d45-d846-5293-999b-e8ec858d4967" :answer